Real-input run of capstone/forget_bpb_kept.py, 26 Nov 2026. Test only: a small stand-in, 3 steps, not a quality result.
Real: p1536 tokenizer (sha256 e6b93a93...25a64b), raw_table_P32.npz (sha256 e19a6cae...39b0), 45 documents of
held-out v1 (3 per slice), Team 5 trainer and KAS V2 head, the team's comparison wrapper, its adapter.yaml, Team 7 store.
Stand-in: model shape (below), synthetic training text and SFT pack. Benchmark rows are made up; none is read.
Machine: CPU only, Python 3.11.16, torch 2.7.1+cpu. PYTHONPATH=<LAB>/teams/07-infrastructure, run from <LAB>.

## arm config (copied into configs/arms for step 1, then removed)
# Stand-in shape only (copied into the arms tree for the one training run, then removed).
inherit: dryrun2.yaml
model: {n_layer: 2, n_embd: 256, n_head: 4, n_kv_head: 2}

## 1. stand-in run folder
python teams/05-architecture/harness/train_week2.py --config teams/05-architecture/configs/arms/zz_g10_standin_small.yaml \
  --runtime teams/05-architecture/configs/runtime.yaml --tokenizer <RUN>/../tokenizer/tokenizer.json --tokenizer-release frozen-p1536 \
  --byte-table teams/04-ke2/results/tables/p1536-s0/raw_table_P32.npz --train-data <RUN>/inputs/pretrain.jsonl \
  --heldout-data <RUN>/inputs/heldout_slice.jsonl --heldout-sources <RUN>/inputs/heldout_slice_sources.jsonl \
  --smoke --smoke-steps 3 --smoke-batch-size 1 --seed 1234 --device cpu \
  --checkpoint-store <RUN>/store --run-id dryrun2-standin --checkpoint-at-start --checkpoint-interval-s 3600 --out <RUN>/standin
